{
 "id": "21.2",
 "module": "m42357",
 "chapter": "21",
 "title": "电动势：端电压",
 "short": "电动势与端电压",
 "lead": "电池是带有自身<span data-concept=\"resistance\">电阻</span>的电能来源，一旦有<span data-concept=\"electric-current\">电流</span>流过，二者共同决定你在其接线端之间测得的量。这里讲述<span data-concept=\"emf\">电动势</span>、<span data-concept=\"internal-resistance\">内阻</span>和<span data-concept=\"terminal-voltage\">端电压</span>，并讲述电源的串联与并联，如手电筒、电池充电器和太阳电池阵列中那样。",
 "objectives": [
  "比较并对比电源的电压与电磁力。",
  "描述当电压源的内阻增大（例如由于电池老化）时，输送给负载的端电压、电流和功率会发生什么变化。",
  "解释为什么使用多个并联的电压源是有益的。"
 ],
 "summary_html": "<ul><li>所有<span data-concept=\"potential-difference\">电压</span>源都有两个基本组成部分——具有特征<span data-concept=\"emf\">电动势</span>（emf）的电能来源，以及<span data-concept=\"internal-resistance\">内阻</span> $\\krint$。</li><li>电动势是电源在没有<span data-concept=\"electric-current\">电流</span>流过时的<span data-concept=\"potential-difference\">电势差</span>。</li><li>电动势的数值取决于<span data-concept=\"potential-difference\">电势差</span>的来源。</li><li><span data-concept=\"potential-difference\">电压</span>源的<span data-concept=\"internal-resistance\">内阻</span> $\\krint$ 在有<span data-concept=\"electric-current\">电流</span>流过时会影响输出<span data-concept=\"potential-difference\">电压</span>。</li><li>器件的输出<span data-concept=\"potential-difference\">电压</span>称为它的<span data-concept=\"terminal-voltage\">端电压</span> $\\kV$，由 $\\kV = \\kemf - \\kIcur\\krint$ 给出，其中 $\\kIcur$ 是<span data-concept=\"electric-current\">电流</span>，当电流从<span data-concept=\"potential-difference\">电压</span>源的正极流出时为正。</li><li>当多个<span data-concept=\"potential-difference\">电压</span>源串联时，它们的<span data-concept=\"internal-resistance\">内阻</span>相加，电动势按代数相加。</li><li>太阳电池可以串联或并联，分别提供更高的<span data-concept=\"potential-difference\">电压</span>或<span data-concept=\"electric-current\">电流</span>。</li></ul>",
 "notes": "书中未给出答案的十道习题已略去，表现单个电池组合成电池组的一幅旧版画也已略去，因为正文并未指引读者去看它。",
